variant OmnitronTechnoTerror
name Omnitron: Techno Terror
from AdelphophagesVillainPromos
base Omnitron
unlock Be defeated by regular Baron Blade in Omnitron IV. Baron Blade must be on his "Vengeful Mad Scientist" side and Partial Omni-Drone must have been destroyed while Resource Recycler is in play.
requires BaronBlade OmnitronIV
challenge Masterful Craft
Increase damage dealt by villain devices by the number of Gun Drones and villain components in play.

variant GrandWarlordVossGeneBoundGeneral
name Grand Warlord Voss: Gene-Bound General
from AdelphophagesVillainPromos
base GrandWarlordVoss
challenge Superior Leaders
Reduce damage dealt to Thorathians by 2.

variant BaronBladeBlackHoleGenerator
name Baron Blade: Black Hole Generator
from AdelphophagesVillainPromos
base BaronBlade
unlock Defeat regular Baron Blade in The Block. Then, be defeated by Kismet in The Block. During the game, at least 3 agents must be destroyed by damage dealt by Kismet.
requires BaronBlade Kismet? TheBlock
challenge Weakened by Gravity
Increase damage taken by hero targets by 1.

variant CitizenDawnSolarEmpress
name Citizen Dawn: Solar Empress
from AdelphophagesVillainPromos
base CitizenDawn
unlock Defeat regular Citizen Dawn without there ever being fewer than H_-_1 citizens in play. Citizen Dawn must have flipped at some point in the game.
requires CitizenDawn
challenge Blindingly Bright
During setup, also place a Sunshield counter on Citizen Dawn.
Increase damage dealt by targets by 1 per Sunshield on them.

variant AkashBhutaPrimordialCreator
name Akash'Bhuta: Primordial Creator
from AdelphophagesVillainPromos InfernalRelics
base AkashBhuta
unlock Defeat Akash'Bhuta in Insula Primalis by damage dealt by Volcanic Eruption.
requires AkashBhuta? InsulaPrimalis
challenge Unstoppable Force
The first time Akash'Bhuta deals damage each turn, that damage is irreducable and doubled.

variant TheEnneadWrathOfTheGods
name The Ennead: Wrath of the Gods
from AdelphophagesVillainPromos InfernalRelics
base TheEnnead
