variant GloomweaverRitualOfGnophos
name GloomWeaver: Ritual of Gnophos
from AdelphophagesVillainPromos InfernalRelics
base Gloomweaver
unlock Defeat Gloomweaver after removing at least 3_zombies, 1_cultist, and 1_voodoo pin from the game.
requires Gloomweaver? Haka?|TheFinalWasteland
challenge Unending Chant
Gloomweaver's end of turn effect also puts cards matching relics removed from the game into play.
Villain Relics can only be destroyed by being reduced to 0 HP.

variant ApostateDarkAngel
name Apostate: Dark Angel
from AdelphophagesVillainPromos InfernalRelics
base Apostate
challenge Relic-Bound
At the end of the villain turn, reveal cards from the top of the villain deck until a relic is revealed. Put it into play and shuffle the remaining cards back into the villain deck.
Double HP regained by Apostate.

